«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  UnifDisQ
  @  Discrete quantile. Stack: Xmin, Xmax, p.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "UnifDisQ: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → Xmin Xmax p « IF 'p<0 OR p>1' EVAL THEN Ⓒ? ELSE 'IFTE(p≤0;Xmin;Xmin+CEIL(p*(Xmax-Xmin+1))-1)' EVAL R→I END Xmin Xmax p 3 →List Drop »
»
